00:40:33,848 --> 00:40:35,766
Ito ang aming espesyal na lugar.

746
00:40:36,392 --> 00:40:38,269
-Ang aming espesyal na lugar.
-Oo.

747
00:40:39,353 --> 00:40:40,771
Alam ko kung ano ito.

748
00:40:40,855 --> 00:40:41,856
saan?

749
00:40:41,939 --> 00:40:44,191
Sa kwarto ni Mrs. Helga.

750
00:40:46,402 --> 00:40:48,946
Kung saan mo tinapon.
Iyan ang iyong espesyal na lugar, tama ba?

751
00:40:49,613 --> 00:40:51,740
-Kalokohan.
-Kalokohan. Diyan ka…

752
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:55,035
Oh crap.

753
00:40:55,119 --> 00:40:58,122
-Ayan. Mukha kang tanga.
-Oh talaga?

754
00:40:58,205 --> 00:40:59,665
ha?

755
00:41:01,167 --> 00:41:03,043
Buti na lang birthday mo.

756
00:41:04,170 --> 00:41:05,296
-Huwag!
-Huh?

757
00:41:05,379 --> 00:41:07,047
-Kaarawan ko.
-Huwag!

758
00:41:07,131 --> 00:41:08,632
Tatanggihan mo ako?

759
00:41:09,425 --> 00:41:11,343
-Okay.
-Ipikit mo ang iyong mga mata.

760
00:41:11,427 --> 00:41:12,470
Handa ka na ba?

761
00:41:12,553 --> 00:41:13,429
Bulots, okay?

762
00:41:18,642 --> 00:41:21,645
Ngiti!

763
00:41:23,022 --> 00:41:24,940
-Wow!
-Maligayang kaarawan.

764
00:41:25,024 --> 00:41:26,942
Happy birthday sa akin.

765
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:32,573
Oo, Pip.

766
00:41:32,656 --> 00:41:34,074
Ito ay magiging mabilis. Pangako.

767
00:41:34,158 --> 00:41:35,534
Okay. Ingat, Bulots, okay?

768
00:41:35,618 --> 00:41:37,328
Sige. Bye-bye.

769
00:41:38,204 --> 00:41:40,915
-Okay, walang problema.
-Naiintindihan namin. salamat po!

770
00:41:40,998 --> 00:41:43,167
-Salamat.
-Saan tayo kakain?

771
00:41:54,345 --> 00:41:56,931
Hello, hello, everyone!

772
00:41:59,099 --> 00:42:01,393
Wow! Nagbago na ang buhay niya.

773
00:42:01,477 --> 00:42:03,479
Anyway, gaya nga ng sinabi ko...

774
00:42:03,562 --> 00:42:05,689
Ngayon ay magiging pagbabago ng buhay.

775
00:42:05,773 --> 00:42:07,441
Kaya maghintay lang tayo ng kaunti.

776
00:42:07,525 --> 00:42:11,111
Ngunit ipinangako namin na ito ay magiging
sulit ang iyong habang. Sige?

777
00:42:11,195 --> 00:42:13,614
Kaya, maghintay na lang tayo ng ilang sandali

778
00:42:13,697 --> 00:42:18,494
dahil nangangako kami
magiging sulit ang iyong oras.

779
00:42:22,873 --> 00:42:23,916
Miss!

780
00:42:23,999 --> 00:42:25,501
Maaari mo ba akong tulungan?

781
00:42:25,584 --> 00:42:28,462
Alin ang mas mabuti para sa iyo? Ito o…

782
00:42:28,546 --> 00:42:31,257
Isuot mo na lang yan. Eto, isuot mo.

783
00:42:32,007 --> 00:42:34,218
-Sigurado ka bang ito ay mas mabuti?
-Oo.

784
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:36,762
Tingnan ko. Harapin mo ako. doon.

785
00:42:37,513 --> 00:42:39,139
Napakagwapo mo.

786
00:42:39,765 --> 00:42:41,600
-Okay na ba ngayon?
-Good luck!

787
00:42:42,226 --> 00:42:44,436
Ang susunod naming performer

788
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:50,776
ay isang record-breaking na kontemporaryong kilusan
piece artist ng kanyang henerasyon.

789
00:42:50,859 --> 00:42:53,112
Ang nag-iisang…

790
00:42:53,195 --> 00:42:55,239
Kropek.

791
00:43:32,735 --> 00:43:34,695
Dahil karapat-dapat ka sa pinakamahusay,

792
00:43:34,778 --> 00:43:38,616
feeling namin deserve mo din
isang pambungad na panalangin.

793
00:43:38,699 --> 00:43:40,367
Tumayo tayong lahat.

794
00:43:49,793 --> 00:43:53,631
Sa ngalan ng Ama…

795
00:43:54,256 --> 00:43:55,424
Ang Anak…

796
00:43:55,507 --> 00:43:58,510
-Ang Espiritu Santo.
-Ang Espiritu Santo.

797
00:43:59,636 --> 00:44:00,721
-Amen.
-Amen.

798
00:44:02,389 --> 00:44:03,223
Isa pa?

799
00:44:05,100 --> 00:44:06,560
-Isa pa.
-Okay.

800
00:44:09,855 --> 00:44:13,609
Tunay na napakaespesyal ng pagtitipong ito

801
00:44:13,692 --> 00:44:17,696
may dialogue kasi kami.

802
00:44:17,780 --> 00:44:19,948
Mayroon kaming cast at direktor,

803
00:44:20,032 --> 00:44:21,742
Pascal Seswa,

804
00:44:21,825 --> 00:44:23,869
beteranong aktor na si Joel Saracho,

805
00:44:23,952 --> 00:44:27,206
Sheryl Diamante, at Celeste De Guia.

806
00:44:27,998 --> 00:44:32,461
Kaya oo, mayroon bang may mga katanungan
para sa aming napaka-exciting na cast?

807
00:44:33,170 --> 00:44:34,254
Ay, oo.

808
00:44:34,338 --> 00:44:37,049
Ikaw na naka-pink na kamukha ni Gen Z.

809
00:44:37,132 --> 00:44:38,008
Oo.

810
00:44:41,970 --> 00:44:44,014
Anong oras magsisimula?

811
00:44:44,098 --> 00:44:46,934
Sobrang excited lang ako.

812
00:44:47,017 --> 00:44:50,062
Aww, ang sweet naman. Excited lang siya.

813
00:44:50,145 --> 00:44:52,398
Pagkatapos nito, magsisimula na

814
00:44:52,481 --> 00:44:55,317
at talagang mararanasan mo

815
00:44:55,401 --> 00:44:57,945
ang pelikula sa buong kaluwalhatian nito.

816
00:44:58,028 --> 00:45:00,239
Lahat ng limang oras nito.

817
00:45:01,198 --> 00:45:03,158
Limang oras?

818
00:45:03,242 --> 00:45:04,993
Limang oras, oo.

819
00:45:17,923 --> 00:45:19,049
nandyan ka pa ba?

820
00:45:19,133 --> 00:45:21,635
Limang oras ang haba ng pelikula. Damn. Paumanhin.

821
00:45:25,264 --> 00:45:27,391
-Miss!
-Naku, Ma'am Sue.

822
00:45:27,474 --> 00:45:29,101
Ma'am, sorry.

823
00:45:29,184 --> 00:45:31,645
Sarado na kami ngayon
para sa isang pribadong kaganapan.

824
00:45:31,728 --> 00:45:33,355
Dalawang bote lang, please.

825
00:45:33,439 --> 00:45:35,274
-Pakiusap, miss.
-Dalawang bote?

826
00:45:36,442 --> 00:45:37,484
Pero, ma'am...

827
00:45:37,568 --> 00:45:38,986
Pakiusap!

828
00:45:39,069 --> 00:45:40,112
Hoy!

829
00:45:40,195 --> 00:45:41,071
Oh!

830
00:45:41,155 --> 00:45:42,364
kamukha mo
nakabihis ka na para sa simbahan.

831
00:45:42,448 --> 00:45:43,615
Bakit nakabihis na kayong lahat?

832
00:45:43,699 --> 00:45:44,992
Oh.

833
00:45:45,075 --> 00:45:47,035
At ikaw ay nasa isang lokal na kainan.

834
00:45:47,828 --> 00:45:48,704
pwede ba?

835
00:45:49,246 --> 00:45:50,080
Oo naman.

836
00:45:53,417 --> 00:45:57,713
Kaya, alinman sa A,

837
00:45:58,422 --> 00:45:59,798
natapon ka.

838
00:45:59,882 --> 00:46:01,383
B,

839
00:46:02,176 --> 00:46:03,760
tumayo ka na, ha?

840
00:46:05,804 --> 00:46:07,181
Letter B.

841
00:46:07,264 --> 00:46:08,140
Panghuling sagot.

842
00:46:08,849 --> 00:46:10,601
Pero bakit dito?

843
00:46:12,394 --> 00:46:13,770
Bakit dito?

844
00:46:15,772 --> 00:46:18,484
Dahil ito ay
kung saan ko unang napagtanto na...

845
00:46:19,735 --> 00:46:20,569
na…

846
00:46:21,862 --> 00:46:22,946
Na mahal ko siya.

847
00:46:25,282 --> 00:46:28,952
Yung babaeng galing sa gym?

848
00:46:30,078 --> 00:46:31,163
Okay.

849
00:46:31,246 --> 00:46:33,290
-Pag may problema tayo--
-Narito, ginoo.

850
00:46:33,373 --> 00:46:35,375
-Isang balde.
-Salamat, miss.

851
00:46:35,459 --> 00:46:39,171
Noong may problema tayo sa pamilya,
dinala niya ako dito.

852
00:46:39,254 --> 00:46:41,548
Binigyan ka ba niya ng payo?

853
00:46:42,090 --> 00:46:42,925
Hindi.

854
00:46:43,008 --> 00:46:45,511
Buong gabi niya lang akong pinapatawa.

855
00:46:45,594 --> 00:46:47,221
Kahit corny ang mga biro niya,

856
00:46:47,304 --> 00:46:48,555
nakuha niya talaga ako.

857
00:46:49,348 --> 00:46:52,100
Nakalimutan ko pang may problema ako noon.

858
00:46:52,726 --> 00:46:53,560
Okay.

859
00:46:54,102 --> 00:46:55,395
Dito.

860
00:46:57,940 --> 00:46:59,066
ano yun?

861
00:46:59,816 --> 00:47:02,277
Kinukit ko ito nang makatulog siya.

862
00:47:02,361 --> 00:47:05,405
kinulit ko kasi ayoko
para makalimutan ang gabing iyon.

863
00:47:06,740 --> 00:47:08,200
Hindi ko gustong kalimutan

864
00:47:08,742 --> 00:47:11,578
sa sandaling natagpuan ko ang tao
sinong magpapasaya sa akin.

865
00:47:23,757 --> 00:47:26,093
Miss. Hoy. tapos na.

866
00:47:26,176 --> 00:47:27,427
Oh, tapos na.

867
00:47:32,516 --> 00:47:33,559
2 a.m na.

868
00:47:34,810 --> 00:47:35,811
Ay hindi!

869
00:47:39,982 --> 00:47:42,442
-Paumanhin, pakiusap. Paumanhin.
-Maghintay!

870
00:47:44,152 --> 00:47:45,028
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

871
00:47:50,909 --> 00:47:53,912
Hoy, RR, isipin mo
yung sinabi ko sayo kanina.

872
00:47:53,996 --> 00:47:57,291
Kailangan namin ng mga boluntaryo sa Fire Department.

873
00:47:59,251 --> 00:48:00,127
Nakaramdam ako ng lamig.

874
00:48:01,086 --> 00:48:02,588
Oh. Dito.

875
00:48:02,671 --> 00:48:04,464
Buti na lang pinaghandaan ko.

876
00:48:08,427 --> 00:48:09,428
salamat po.

877
00:48:12,681 --> 00:48:13,640
Hoy!

878
00:48:13,724 --> 00:48:15,392
Nandiyan ang matalik mong kaibigan.

879
00:48:22,649 --> 00:48:23,609
Hello.

880
00:48:25,611 --> 00:48:26,778
Pip.

881
00:48:27,863 --> 00:48:29,615
Nanlamig din ako, alam mo ba.

882
00:48:30,699 --> 00:48:31,658
Kunin mo.

883
00:48:34,119 --> 00:48:34,995
Sue.

884
00:48:35,912 --> 00:48:37,164
sa kanya yan.

885
00:48:37,706 --> 00:48:40,250
Okay. Go, go, go.

886
00:48:40,917 --> 00:48:41,752
Pumunta ka.

887
00:48:42,669 --> 00:48:43,629
Ang lamig talaga.

888
00:48:52,971 --> 00:48:54,806
Eksperto sa gym, tama ba?

889
00:48:55,515 --> 00:48:56,433
Slash.

890
00:48:57,059 --> 00:48:59,353
Aktibista sa kapaligiran.

891
00:48:59,436 --> 00:49:00,270
Slash.

892
00:49:00,354 --> 00:49:01,647
Nai-publish na may-akda.

893
00:49:01,730 --> 00:49:02,981
At slash.

894
00:49:04,066 --> 00:49:05,984
Mukhang nasa iyo na ang lahat, ha?

895
00:49:07,486 --> 00:49:08,612
Tama ba, Pip?

896
00:49:10,197 --> 00:49:12,199
Siya nga pala si Sue.

897
00:49:12,783 --> 00:49:14,701
-At ito naman si Janine.
-Hi.

898
00:49:14,785 --> 00:49:16,411
Ikinagagalak kitang makilala.

899
00:49:17,245 --> 00:49:19,289
Pip? Bakit Pip ang tawag mo sa kanya?

900
00:49:20,123 --> 00:49:21,541
Hindi ba RR ang pangalan niya?

901
00:49:21,625 --> 00:49:24,503
Akala nila mute ako
noong elementary.

902
00:49:25,962 --> 00:49:27,381
Pwede ba kitang tawaging Pip?

903
00:49:27,464 --> 00:49:28,674
-Oo naman!
-Hindi!

904
00:49:29,383 --> 00:49:30,300
Hoy!

905
00:49:30,384 --> 00:49:32,094
ako lang mag isa
sino kayang tumatawag sayo niyan diba?

906
00:49:32,177 --> 00:49:33,220
Atin lang yan.

907
00:49:33,845 --> 00:49:35,555
Anyways…

908
00:49:35,639 --> 00:49:37,933
Niyaya ko si RR

909
00:49:38,016 --> 00:49:41,937
para makasama ako sa BFP volunteer program.

910
00:49:42,020 --> 00:49:43,271
BFP?

911
00:49:44,022 --> 00:49:45,065
Bumbero?

912
00:49:46,066 --> 00:49:47,275
Delikado yan.

913
00:49:47,818 --> 00:49:49,027
At hey.

914
00:49:49,111 --> 00:49:51,571
Hindi mo ba sinabi sa akin
magfofocus ka ba sa midterms mo?

915
00:49:51,655 --> 00:49:54,658
Tungkol naman sa aking organisasyon,

916
00:49:55,283 --> 00:49:58,537
nagpadala sila ng mga boluntaryo sa Sudan.

917
00:49:58,620 --> 00:50:00,288
-Sudan?
-Oo.

918
00:50:00,372 --> 00:50:02,916
Magandang training yan para kay RR.

919
00:50:02,999 --> 00:50:04,292
Oo.

920
00:50:04,376 --> 00:50:07,170
Miyembro ka ng
Tagapangalaga ng Sangkatauhan, tama ba?

921
00:50:07,254 --> 00:50:08,922
Hindi lang member.

922
00:50:09,756 --> 00:50:12,759
Isa sa Lupon ng mga Direktor.

923
00:50:15,470 --> 00:50:19,099
No wonder bored na bored ako sayo ngayon.

924
00:50:19,182 --> 00:50:20,434
ha?

925
00:50:21,518 --> 00:50:23,228
Paano ang pag-aaral mo?

926
00:50:24,312 --> 00:50:25,814
Magandang opportunity yun para kay RR.

927
00:50:25,897 --> 00:50:30,652
Kailangan natin ng taong kasing hilig ni RR.

928
00:50:30,736 --> 00:50:31,737
madamdamin?

929
00:50:32,612 --> 00:50:33,447
Bakit?

930
00:50:34,322 --> 00:50:37,576
Kayo ba ay panghabambuhay na kaibigan?
May childhood memories ba kayong magkasama?

931
00:50:38,368 --> 00:50:39,619
Hey.

932
00:50:39,703 --> 00:50:40,871
ngayon lang kayo nagkakilala.

933
00:50:40,954 --> 00:50:43,540
-Hoy.
-Hindi titigil ang pag-aaral niya.

934
00:50:43,623 --> 00:50:47,544
Ibig kong sabihin, tatagal lang ng isang taon,

935
00:50:47,627 --> 00:50:49,629
at pagkatapos ay iniisip ko

936
00:50:50,422 --> 00:50:52,716
gagawa siya ng mabuti doon.

937
00:50:53,550 --> 00:50:57,179
Anyways, sabi sa akin ni RR.

938
00:50:57,262 --> 00:50:59,890
Napanood mo ang espesyal na screening

939
00:50:59,973 --> 00:51:02,642
ng bagong pelikulang Pascal Seswa.

940
00:51:03,268 --> 00:51:06,313
-Ako ay isang fan!
-Oo!

941
00:51:06,396 --> 00:51:09,608
At alam mo, ang sweet talaga ni Kenzo.

942
00:51:09,691 --> 00:51:11,568
Kenzo?

943
00:51:11,651 --> 00:51:14,446
Niyaya niya pa akong mag-dinner
pagkatapos naming manood ng sine.

944
00:51:14,529 --> 00:51:15,489
Hapunan?

945
00:51:17,073 --> 00:51:18,492
Malapit na mag alas tres!

946
00:51:18,575 --> 00:51:20,494
Oh, ibig kong sabihin,

947
00:51:20,577 --> 00:51:22,579
meryenda sa hatinggabi!

948
00:51:22,662 --> 00:51:25,540
O baka almusal.
Piliin mo lang kung alin ang gusto mo.

949
00:51:25,624 --> 00:51:27,334
Buti na lang wala kang allergy.

950
00:51:27,417 --> 00:51:29,044
Hindi, hindi ko ginawa.

951
00:51:29,127 --> 00:51:32,464
Dahil may mga paramedic
naka standby para sa akin.

952
00:51:33,173 --> 00:51:34,883
Ganun siya ka-sweet.

953
00:51:34,966 --> 00:51:36,676
Ang ganda kaya!

954
00:51:36,760 --> 00:51:38,386
Napakaganda, tama?

955
00:51:38,470 --> 00:51:40,430
-Napakaganda nito! Wow!
-Diyos ko!

956
00:51:40,514 --> 00:51:42,432
-Ang ganda talaga!
- Napakaganda nito!

957
00:51:42,516 --> 00:51:44,643
Ang ganda talaga!

958
00:51:44,726 --> 00:51:46,436
- Napakaganda!
- Napakaganda!

959
00:51:46,520 --> 00:51:49,731
-Maganda!
-Tama? Ang ganda talaga!

960
00:51:51,399 --> 00:51:53,443
Kaya? Girlfriend mo na ba siya?

961
00:51:55,612 --> 00:51:57,823
Kakakilala ko lang sa kanya.
Paano niya ako naging girlfriend?

962
00:51:58,990 --> 00:52:00,075
May pagkakataon ba?

963
00:52:00,784 --> 00:52:01,660
ginagawa namin.

964
00:52:09,084 --> 00:52:10,377
Nandiyan ka ba buong gabi?

965
00:52:11,002 --> 00:52:11,878
Oo.

966
00:52:12,963 --> 00:52:14,214
Bakit ang dami mong tanong?

967
00:52:14,297 --> 00:52:18,593
Mali bang maging curious
tungkol sa magiging partner ng best friend ko?

968
00:52:21,179 --> 00:52:22,430
Mature na siya.

969
00:52:23,473 --> 00:52:24,683
Ibibigay ko sa kanya yan.

970
00:52:25,308 --> 00:52:27,269
Baka iyon ang kailangan mo.

971
00:52:27,352 --> 00:52:28,854
tama ka.

972
00:52:28,937 --> 00:52:30,146
Mature na siya.

973
00:52:30,981 --> 00:52:33,149
Unlike you, na napaka-immature.

974
00:52:40,615 --> 00:52:41,449
anong ginagawa mo

975
00:52:42,075 --> 00:52:43,076
Bakit?

976
00:52:44,160 --> 00:52:46,580
Hindi ba pwedeng maging sweet ako sa best friend ko?

977
00:52:47,956 --> 00:52:51,084
Natatakot ka bang mawala ako sayo
dahil sa kanya?

978
00:52:53,336 --> 00:52:54,671
Na mawawalan ako ng oras sayo?

979
00:52:55,589 --> 00:52:56,756
Killjoy.

980
00:53:01,761 --> 00:53:03,138
pero oo,

981
00:53:03,221 --> 00:53:04,890
bilang makasarili bilang ito ay maaaring tunog.

982
00:53:08,768 --> 00:53:09,895
Buti na lang alam mo.

983
00:53:10,937 --> 00:53:12,647
Napaka selfish mo.

984
00:53:12,731 --> 00:53:16,902
At least ngayon alam mo na ang paborito kong seafood.

985
00:53:16,985 --> 00:53:18,153
ha?

986
00:53:18,778 --> 00:53:20,864
Shellfish!

987
00:53:22,365 --> 00:53:23,825
Ang corny mo.

988
00:53:23,909 --> 00:53:25,410
Oo, tanga.

989
00:53:26,077 --> 00:53:27,287
Nakangiti ka.

